                                     Table "public.funcionario"
       Column        |          Type          | Collation | Nullable |            Default            
---------------------+------------------------+-----------+----------+-------------------------------
 cpf                 | character(11)          |           | not null | 
 pnome               | character varying(50)  |           | not null | 
 unome               | character varying(50)  |           | not null | 
 email               | character varying(50)  |           |          | 
 endereco            | character varying(100) |           |          | 'Macau-RN'::character varying
 salario             | numeric(7,2)           |           |          | 
 data_nasc           | date                   |           |          | 
 sexo                | character(1)           |           |          | 
 cpf_supervisor      | character(11)          |           |          | 
 numero_departamento | smallint               |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "funcionario_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (cpf)
    "funcionario_email_key" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (email)
Check constraints:
    "funcionario_salario_check" CHECK (salario >= 2000::numeric AND salario <= 15000::numeric)
    "funcionario_sexo_check" CHECK (lower(sexo::text) = ANY (ARRAY['m'::text, 'f'::text, 'o'::text]))
Foreign-key constraints:
    "funcionario_cpf_supervisor_fk" FOREIGN KEY (cpf_supervisor) REFERENCES funcionario(cpf) ON UPDATE CASCADE ON DELETE SET NULL
    "funcionario_num_dep_fk" FOREIGN KEY (numero_departamento) REFERENCES departamento(numero) ON UPDATE CASCADE
Referenced by:
    TABLE "departamento" CONSTRAINT "departamento_cpf_gerente_fk" FOREIGN KEY (cpf_gerente) REFERENCES funcionario(cpf) ON UPDATE CASCADE ON DELETE SET NULL
    TABLE "funcionario" CONSTRAINT "funcionario_cpf_supervisor_fk" FOREIGN KEY (cpf_supervisor) REFERENCES funcionario(cpf) ON UPDATE CASCADE ON DELETE SET NULL

